{
  "_createdAt": "2026-11-04T17:31:13Z",
  "_id": "post-new-chapter",
  "_rev": "Mj8jZDV099qjkJYi2zIe4c",
  "_system": {
    "base": {
      "id": "post-new-chapter",
      "rev": "OXKzsTJ7Efs4i6zOkQS55N"
    }
  },
  "_type": "blogPost",
  "_updatedAt": "2026-11-05T03:23:06Z",
  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "k00122",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k00123",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "We have some fantastic news to share with the Vineland community!"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k00124",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k00125",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "At Uriah Child Care, our mission has always been to provide high-quality, nurturing care for your little ones. To better serve the growing needs of families in Vineland and the surrounding areas, we are thrilled to announce our "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k00126",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "grand opening and expansion"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k00127",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " into a brand-new facility."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k00128",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k00129",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "We have officially moved and expanded to our new home at "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0012a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "30 W Chestnut Ave, Vineland, NJ 08360"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0012b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". The larger space lets us welcome more children into the Uriah family, with more room for learning, play and growth. You can "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0012d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0012c"
          ],
          "text": "see photos of the center"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0012e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k0012c",
          "_type": "link",
          "internal": {
            "_ref": "page-our-center",
            "_type": "reference"
          },
          "linkType": "internal"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0012f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k0012g",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Flexible care for modern families"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0012h",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k0012i",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Life for today's parents doesn't always fit a 9-to-5 schedule. Parents work early mornings, evenings and weekends to provide for their families, and finding reliable child care shouldn't add to that stress."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0012j",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k0012k",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "That is why we are open "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0012l",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Monday to Saturday, 6 am to 11 pm"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0012m",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". Whether you work early, late or on Saturday, your child has a safe, engaging place to be. See "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0012o",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0012n"
          ],
          "text": "child care for every shift"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0012p",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k0012n",
          "_type": "link",
          "internal": {
            "_ref": "category-shift-care",
            "_type": "reference"
          },
          "linkType": "internal"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0012q",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k0012r",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Subsidy news for 2026"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0012s",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k0012t",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "We believe money shouldn't stand between a child and good care. When we wrote this post, the New Jersey Child Care Assistance Program (CCAP) was preparing to reopen for new applications in January 2026, after a pause because of limited funding."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0012u",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k0012v",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Limited reopening and priorities:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0012w",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " because funding was limited, the first openings were set aside for priority groups, including families with very low incomes, children with special needs and families experiencing homelessness."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0012x",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k0012y",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Registration first:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0012z",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " families complete a registration form at "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k00131",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k00130"
          ],
          "text": "mynjhelps.gov"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k00132",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " to be considered, and are told when they can complete the full application."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k00130",
          "_type": "link",
          "external": "https://www.mynjhelps.gov/home",
          "linkType": "external",
          "openInNewTab": true
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k00133",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k00134",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Local office:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k00135",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " in Cumberland County the program is managed locally by Rutgers Southern Regional CCR&R in Vineland, but you still start with the statewide registration form."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k00136",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k00137",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For where things stand today and how we can help with the steps, see our "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k00139",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k00138"
          ],
          "text": "CCAP child care page"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0013a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k00138",
          "_type": "link",
          "internal": {
            "_ref": "service-ccap",
            "_type": "reference"
          },
          "linkType": "internal"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0013b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k0013c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Open enrollment"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0013d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k0013e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "We are enrolling children ages 2.5 and up at our new location. Spaces fill quickly, especially for evening and Saturday care, so reach out soon."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0013f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k0013g",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Call "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0013i",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0013h"
          ],
          "text": "(856) 455-6701"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0013j",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " or "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0013l",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0013k"
          ],
          "text": "book a tour"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0013m",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". We can't wait to welcome you to our new home!"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k0013h",
          "_type": "link",
          "linkType": "phone",
          "phone": "8564556701"
        },
